  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen you change Nameplate Display options in the Quick Menu, the change directly gets shown even though normally in the Quick Menu you always see the full nameplate with the extra Quick Menu info. This only happens when changing it, when you close the Quick Menu and reopen it, it will display the normal Quick Menu Info and work as intended.\n# Suggestion:\nIf this is done intentional so you can see what it will look like, I think it should revert to show the Nameplate in it's \"Quick Menu open\" state after a few seconds. That way you can still see what it will look like but wont lose your Quick Menu info until you reopen the Quick Menu.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/s4krj8",
